   "type": "decision",
   "title": "1858: you are Darwin and you receive an unexpected letter",
   "html": "<p>For twenty years you have been collecting evidence for natural selection, but you have not yet published anything: you want to be sure and you fear the reactions. One day a letter arrives from <b>Alfred Russel Wallace</b>, a young naturalist working in the islands of Indonesia: he describes, almost in your own words, the same theory!</p>",
   "question": "What do you do?",
